    {
      "name": "dsh-ladder-superagents",
      "title": {
        "en": "Ladder Superagents",
        "zh": "阶梯超级智能体"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A ten-slot model ladder for subagents: rank your models T1 to T10, pass a 1-10 difficulty, and the plugin picks the weakest tier that still covers it. Failed routes fall back to the next tier, every configuration can be verified with a real call, and the settings page edits the ladder by drag and drop.",
        "zh": "给子代理用的十槽模型阶梯：把模型排成 T1–T10，交任务时只报 1–10 的难度，插件挑仍能覆盖它的最弱一档；失败自动降档，每个配置都能用真实调用验证，设置页可拖拽编辑。"
      },
      "icon": "icon.svg",
      "author": "Yukikaze-Ai",
